          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum awinjo dwal calu pa dhaku m’ubenyol, ndiba calu pa ng’atu m’ubenyolo nyathin pare ma kayu, en e dwal pa Nyasayuni, m’uyuyo kara eyui, m’uthang’u cinge, m’uwacu kumae, Can i wia kawono mire! kum ng’eyong’ec para voc i wang’ junek.",
          "type": "text",
